# Single source of truth for pinned tool versions and warning thresholds.
# Read by bin/agent-check and by .github/workflows/ci.yml, so the gate and CI
# cannot drift apart.
#
# Values are kept here rather than being passed on the command line
# (`VAR=n bin/agent-check`), because Claude Code allow-rules stop matching once
# a command begins with an environment assignment.
#
# Not listed here on purpose:
#   Go version -> go.mod (`go` directive); CI uses go-version-file: go.mod

# golangci-lint is unpinned nowhere: `version: latest` silently rolled from
# v1 to v2 and broke the action, so the version is pinned in this one place.
GOLANGCI_LINT_VERSION=v2.13.2

# Warning budget: this repo is at zero and stays at zero, so there is no
# allowance to configure. If a linter ever cannot be driven to zero, put its
# ceiling here instead of loosening the rule.
